# A sweep's corners rounded (F4): the rectangle of sweep_corner.tlspr
# swept along its two lines, mitred; [round] on the group's screen asks
# for a corner radius, and with 3 the corner is an arc on the path; the
# screen shows the radius, and the solid is checked.
file $testdata/ui/sweep_corner.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
click-entity 40000
click-entity 50000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
twmove 186 205
twdown L 186 205
twup L 186 205
edit 3
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
